OBJECTIVE            KUBECTL MONITORING AND TROUBLESHOOTING COMMANDS
========================================================================================================================
Monitor HPA Status   kubectl get hpa web-app-autoscaler -w
Inspect HPA Events   kubectl describe hpa web-app-autoscaler
Check Live Metrics   kubectl top pods -l app=web-worker
Simulate CPU Load    kubectl run vcpu-load --rm -i -t --image=busybox -- md5sum /dev/zero
